{"version": 1, "updated_at": "2026-10-14T10:14:06Z", "items": [{"id": "feed-c62180088501", "title": "对冲基金减持科技股，Mag 7持仓却创历史新高！高盛：市场处处创纪录，唯独缺乏信心", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783421", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/45b40581-8a86-45e7-8dc7-629023547f05.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "标普屡创新高之际，市场内部正在发生截然相反的事情。对冲基金一边抛售科技股，一边将\"Mag", "published_at": "2026-10-12T06:49:27Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-12T10:13:13Z", "body": "bodies/feed-c62180088501.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-7d725992ce73", "title": "AI运动硬件公司获数亿B轮融资，用体育大模型重构网球自主训练体验｜硬氪首发", "source": "36氪", "author": "", "url": "https://36kr.com/p/3990015565708035?f=rss", "image_url": "https://img.36krcdn.com/hsossms/20261010/v2_7c5ece83ab0e418ebd1bedfe5f501f43@6022551_oswg1497999oswg1500oswg1049_img_png?x-oss-process=image/quality,q_90/format,jpg/interlace,1", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["36氪", "Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "科技", "网球"], "excerpt": "作者｜黄楠\n\n\n编辑｜袁斯来\n\n\n硬氪获悉，AI体育硬件公司「庞伯特」近日完成数亿元B轮融资，由上海国投先导基金领投，元禾璞华、浦东创投等跟投，老股东蓝驰创投持续加注。高鹄资本担任独家财务顾问。\n\n\n此前公司已连续完成三轮A轮系列融资，神骐资本、明势创投、蓝驰创投、锦秋基金、华创资本及成为资本等头部机构集体参与。\n\n\n", "published_at": "2026-10-11T10:10:43Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-11T10:12:12Z", "body": "bodies/feed-7d725992ce73.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-f284d9125b3f", "title": "传折叠屏 iPhone 维修费 8000 元，苹果：价格未公布；腾讯 Chatterfly 输入法开启内测；软高管：AI 训练是「人类历史上最大规模的劳动盗窃」｜极客早知道", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370608", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/97/17/9717c4d34c65f492b40427b7338b6e35.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "极客公园", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n谷歌最新旗舰模型 Gemini 4 Pro 疑似「偷跑」，多项指标领先 Astra 和 Fable 5.1\n\n\n9 月 18 日，Google 下一代旗舰模型 Gemini 4 Pro 疑似正以「gemini-3.8-flash」名称「偷跑」上线。据反馈，谷歌在 Arena 等基准平台上测试了其最强 Gemini", "published_at": "2026-09-19T00:01:42Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-19T11:32:07Z", "body": "bodies/feed-f284d9125b3f.json", "engagement": 230, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-cd01d8655e05", "title": "2021-08-29 - FIFA Beach Soccer World Cup - Match 32 - Russian Football Union v Japan - Japanese anthem", "source": "Wikimedia Commons", "author": "Wikimedia Commons", "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a3/2021-08-29_-_FIFA_Beach_Soccer_World_Cup_-_Match_32_-_Russian_Football_Union_v_Japan_-_Japanese_anthem.webm?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "image_url": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/2021-08-29_-_FIFA_Beach_Soccer_World_Cup_-_Match_32_-_Russian_Football_Union_v_Japan_-_Japanese_anthem.webm/960px--2021-08-29_-_FIFA_Beach_Soccer_World_Cup_-_Match_32_-_Russian_Football_Union_v_Japan_-_Japanese_anthem.webm.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo", "video_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a3/2021-08-29_-_FIFA_Beach_Soccer_World_Cup_-_Match_32_-_Russian_Football_Union_v_Japan_-_Japanese_anthem.webm?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "thumbnail_url": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/2021-08-29_-_FIFA_Beach_Soccer_World_Cup_-_Match_32_-_Russian_Football_Union_v_Japan_-_Japanese_anthem.webm/960px--2021-08-29_-_FIFA_Beach_Soccer_World_Cup_-_Match_32_-_Russian_Football_Union_v_Japan_-_Japanese_anthem.webm.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo", "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": true, "category": "Sports", "topic": "soccer", "content_type": "video", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Sports", "Wikimedia Commons", "en", "soccer", "video", "旅行探店", "日语学习", "足球"], "excerpt": "Freely-licensed video from Wikimedia", "published_at": "2023-12-24T17:45:01Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-11T20:05:13Z", "body": "bodies/feed-cd01d8655e05.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-5898f17cfe8c", "title": "8点1氪丨茶百道涉IPO欺诈，被暂停交易；苹果连夜发布3款智能家居新品，总市值再创历史新高；DeepSeek将完成1000亿元融资", "source": "36氪", "author": "", "url": "https://36kr.com/p/4025027267580036?f=rss", "image_url": null, "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["36氪", "Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "今日热点导览\n\n\n字节跳动Seed单独设立大模型安全与对齐部门\n\n\n爆火促销被指加盟商买单，霸王茶姬回应\n\n\n拒签《暗影蜘蛛侠》AI授权协议，美知名演员尼古拉斯·凯奇“硬刚”亚马逊\n\n\n梁文锋或再投一家机器人公司\n\n\n峰学蔚来武亮回应财产转移相关质疑\n\n\n腾讯启动50亿美元债券发行，为AI支出募资\n\n\nTOP3大新闻\n", "published_at": "2026-10-14T10:11:11Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-14T10:13:29Z", "body": "bodies/feed-5898f17cfe8c.json", "engagement": 210, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-45e4ed7e50cc", "title": "AI气象大模型公司获厚雪数千万投资，已建成自有卫星星座丨36氪首发", "source": "36氪", "author": "", "url": "https://36kr.com/p/4023671039070081?f=rss", "image_url": "https://img.36krcdn.com/hsossms/20261013/v2_8d60e0b5e79746d08cbd2dc9ae37729a@6221844_oswg1758626oswg1268oswg714_img_png?x-oss-process=image/quality,q_90/format,jpg/interlace,1", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["36氪", "Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "投资", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n图源/企业\n\n本文约3300字，建议阅读7分钟\n\n作者丨欧雪\n\n\n编辑丨袁斯来\n\n\n硬氪获悉，气象AI公司天序智能科技（嘉兴）有限公司（下称“天序智能”）近期已完成数千万元Pre-A+轮融资，由厚雪资本独家投资，翊荣资本担任长期独家财务顾问。本轮融资资金将主要用于“凝空星座”建设、CMAWSPAI及垂类世界模型迭代、", "published_at": "2026-10-13T10:11:03Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-13T10:12:50Z", "body": "bodies/feed-45e4ed7e50cc.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-086f55b86362", "title": "美股接近历史高点，机构却忧虑重重！高盛合伙人：不要跟市场对抗", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783368", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/1351d9a7-6960-47fe-9bdd-c41e169fd484.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "社会话题"], "excerpt": "美股在接近历史高点之际，市场内部的结构性分化正在达到极端水平，机构投资者的担忧情绪也随之升温。\n\n\n高盛合伙人Wilson在最新报告中坚持看多立场，建议投资者不要对抗市场的高度集中性，并预计年底前股市仍有上涨空间。然而，来自高盛内部及摩根士丹利、美银等机构的多位策略师对此提出异议，认为宏观环境趋难、科技板块定位已不再是", "published_at": "2026-10-11T08:07:20Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-11T10:12:12Z", "body": "bodies/feed-086f55b86362.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-abb1f903b6f1", "title": "德银：美股7月下旬以来的“第五轮科技股反弹”已到顶，准备迎接“倒V反转”", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783359", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/040ddb70-d25b-4567-8528-e33d80c5bfa3.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "科技"], "excerpt": "自7月29日启动的这轮美股科技股反弹，在52个交易日内累计跑赢大盘18.1个百分点。但在德意志银行看来，这轮行情已经到顶。\n\n\n据追风交易台消息，10月9日，该行多资产策略团队Parag Thatte等分析师发布报告，将美股科技及大盘成长股（MCG &", "published_at": "2026-10-11T03:46:15Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-11T10:12:12Z", "body": "bodies/feed-abb1f903b6f1.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-ced820c51ced", "title": "Jev 开发商估值已达 75 亿美元；苹果投资 AI 音频初创；传 OpenAI、Anthropic 高管私下推演 AI 灾难场景", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/372184", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/5c/d1/5cd1326158f94461a6a2390db681667c.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "投资", "极客公园", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n内存等成本压力上升，2027 全球笔记本价格恐继续上涨\n\n\n市场调查机构集邦咨询（Trendforce）于 10 月 8 日发布博文，表示如果零部件价格继续维持高位，品牌扩大成本转嫁，终端涨价可能延长用户换机周期，预估 2027 年全球笔记本市场面临出货、价格双重影响。\n\n\n在 2026 年第 3 季度以建议零售价", "published_at": "2026-10-10T01:27:14Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-10T10:12:43Z", "body": "bodies/feed-ced820c51ced.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-e29bc3bfe9b5", "title": "特斯拉欧洲改称“TAD”，辅助驾驶的边界仍待审批厘清", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783327", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/content_default_20.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "旅行探店", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n特斯拉坚守了十年的“FSD”，在欧洲还是更名了。\n\n\n当地时间10月9日，特斯拉德国、比利时和丹麦官网已将原称“完全自动驾驶（监督版）”的功能改称“Tesla Assisted", "published_at": "2026-10-10T08:23:37Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-10T10:12:43Z", "body": "bodies/feed-e29bc3bfe9b5.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-a23cdb9d226d", "title": "ChatGPT 推出全新 IUI 智能用户界面；谷歌推出试验性 AI 游戏平台 Playground；苹果被曝联合 LG 开发门锁、摄像头等智能家居配件｜极客早知道", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/372090", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/9e/40/9e40f9772b90b2e469e4dc6938518a66.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "极客公园", "游戏", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n2026 年诺贝尔化学奖公布：二人因解开不对称有机合成难题获奖，其中一位 96 岁高龄\n\n\n10 月 7 日，2026 年诺