ed88e9e7f4", "title": "日本央行行长植田和男：将根据经济和物价情况继续加息", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782067", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/d0/24/94/-1-2-.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "旅行探店", "社会话题"], "excerpt": "周五（9月18日），日本央行行长植田和男在记者会上表示，随着企业加薪意愿增强、定价行为趋于积极，中长期通胀预期持续上升，日本潜在通胀率存在超过2%目标的上行风险。他强调，将根据经济和物价走势继续推进加息，同时将物价趋势稳定在2%左右视为核心政策目标。\n\n植田和男称，受人工智能需求旺盛、原油价格近期回升以及日元持续偏弱等", "published_at": "2026-09-18T06:38:07Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-18T10:12:20Z", "body": "bodies/feed-88ed88e9e7f4.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-87a3330862ff", "title": "Drama Around A PS5 Exploit, AI-Coding, Linux, And GTA 6 Has One Popular Hacker Calling It Quits", "source": "Kotaku", "author": "Zack Zwiezen", "url": "https://kotaku.com/popular-playstation-hacker-calling-it-quits-due-to-ai-using-slop-kiddies-reporting-important-bug-to-sony-2000735105", "image_url": "https://kotaku.com/app/uploads/2026/04/gta5hack-1280x720.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "gaming", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "Kotaku", "en", "gaming", "text", "游戏", "科技"], "excerpt": "A prominent PlayStation modder and hacker has had enough. He was working on a project to bring Linux to newer PS5 models running more recent firmware when he", "published_at": "2026-09-16T18:20:26Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-17T10:12:06Z", "body": "bodies/feed-87a3330862ff.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-3b53c51fe4ab", "title": "高盛对冲基金主管：“零日期权”压制美股波动，科技和能源仍是最佳选择", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3781777", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/e0a6eaa3-4245-4727-8de8-453fc9d9